### 1) Registracija (vrati token) - pokreni jednom
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dino",
  "email": "dino@example.com",
  "password": "lozinka123",
  "displayName": "Dino"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2) Login (vrati token) - koristi ako user vec postoji
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "dino",
  "password": "lozinka123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3) Zasticeni endpoint - koristi uhvaceni token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Isti endpoint BEZ tokena - treba vratiti 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/roles

### 5) Javni ping
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ping
